    "Number bonds are pairs that join to make a number.",
    "The bonds of 10: 1+9, 2+8, 3+7, 4+6, 5+5 — and 0+10!",
    "Knowing bonds of 10 makes BIG adding easy: for 8 + 5, take 2 from the 5 to make 10, then add the leftover 3 → 13!",
    "Practice until you can say them as fast as lightning. ⚡"
